      "text": "\"RŪH was born from our love for thoughtful design and the brands that shaped our own wardrobes. We wanted to build a label\nthat balances enduring staples with modern sensibilities. Now that you're here, take a moment to explore the collection—you\nmight just find the piece you never take off.\" - Sneha Acharya, Founder",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\"RŪH was born from our love for thoughtful design and the brands that shaped our own wardrobes. We wanted to build a label that balances enduring staples with modern sensibilities. Now that you're here, take a moment to explore the collection—you might just find the piece you never take off.\" - Sneha Acharya, Founder",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
